<title>USA: Dun &amp; Bradstreet says spin off on schedule.</title>
<headline>Dun &amp; Bradstreet says spin off on schedule.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dun &amp; Bradstreet Corp said on Wednesday that it has received favorable securities and tax rulings on its restructuring, allowing it to proceed on schedule with its spin-off plans.</p>
<p>The company also said the tax ruling allows the restructuring to occur on a &quot;tax-efficient&quot; basis for the company and its stockholders.</p>
<p>The company said plans are on schedule for its subsidiaries, Cognizant Corp and ACNielsen Corp, to become independent entities on November 1.</p>
</text>
